enter your project dir and activate env then run:




>>> uwsgi --http :8000 --wsgi-file test.py
the web client <-> uWSGI <-> Python


>>> python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000
the web client <-> Django_light_server <-> python


>>> uwsgi --http :8000 --module mysite.wsgi
the web client <-> uWSGI <-> Django_app


>>> systemctl start nginx # on port 8000
>>> uwsgi --http :8001 --module mysite.wsgi
the web client <-> nginx <-> uWSGI <-> Django_app

